WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.250
Above the clouds, a little
adventure is about to bloom.

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:11.050
Through floating gardens, a curious girl rides
towards a tree full of ruby-red cherries.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.150
One brave leap… and she’s ready.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:26.050
With a flick of her wand, the cherries dance through
the air, landing softly in her floating basket.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:31.950
A friendly bee buzzes past,
showing her the way.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:36.950
With her harvest gathered, she
leaps towards the little mill.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:39.550
Her journey has only just begun.
